  description: "The Local Racing League is the entry-level competition where new
    captains and teams prove their skills on the water.\\n  Featuring 8 determined
    crews, races are held over 8 Sunday race days with a maximum of 4 boats per heat.\\n 
    Each race demands strategy, speed, and adaptability as teams compete for points,
    currency, and experience.\\n \\n   The league is your chance to gain promotion.
    \\nThe top 2 teams at the end of the season rise to higher leagues, while the
    rest will be stuck behind.\\nThe league provides steady rewards \u2014 125 coins
    per race to the winners and 500 coins per season for the Champion \u2014\\nmaking
    it the perfect training ground for ambitious racers before moving on to more
    prestigious competitions."
